cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, code or results, please cite it as below."
title: "Unsourced precision: do Claude models state clinical numbers that no published source supports?"
abstract: >-
  Preregistered, timestamped evaluation of three Claude models on 60 real
  French patient search queries (dermatology, aesthetic medicine, eye region),
  each labelled against the literature as sourced, not found or contested.
  Measures overprecision and utility (Q1) and whether a model can tell its own
  sourced numbers from unsourced ones (Q2).
authors:
